@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>Terms of Service · Blokemon</PageTitle>

@*
    Anonymous and linkable on its own. The version a person accepts when they create an account
    is the date shown here, which is the terms module's version: the server records that date on
    the account. Written in Simplified Technical English.
*@
<article class="document" aria-labelledby="terms-heading">
    <header class="topline">
        <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Terms</span>
            <h1 id="terms-heading">Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="document-lead">These terms apply when you play Blokemon at blokemon.monster. Version @Terms.Version.</p>
