    </header>

    <div class="document-body">
        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="gamepad-2" /> What Blokemon is</h2>
            <p>Blokemon is a free card game that you play in a browser. The operator of blokemon.monster runs it. Blokemon is a work of parody.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="badge-check" /> Your agreement</h2>
            <p>When you create an account, you accept these terms. The server records the version that you accepted. If you do not accept these terms, you can still play a browser game without an account.</p>
            <p>You must be at least 13 years old to create an account.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="user" /> Your account</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>You are responsible for your password, your passkeys and your recovery codes. Keep them private.</li>
                <li>Your player name must not be offensive, and it must not pretend that you are another person.</li>
                <li>You can erase your account at any time from your profile page.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="shield-check" /> Fair play</h2>
            <p>Do not do these things:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Do not use tools or scripts that change how the game plays.</li>
                <li>Do not try to break into the server, other accounts or other channels.</li>
                <li>Do not send more requests than a person can make by playing.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>If you break these rules, the operator can disable or erase your account.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="wallet-cards" /> Content</h2>
            <p>The cards, the art and the text of Blokemon belong to their creators. You can play with them. You must not copy them, sell them or use them outside the game without permission.</p>
            <p>You allow the operator to store your player name, your decks and your battles, and to show your player name in the game.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="triangle-alert" /> No warranty</h2>
            <p>Blokemon is provided "as is", without a warranty of any kind. The game can change, stop or lose data. The operator is not liable for lost game data or for time you cannot play.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="refresh-cw" /> Changes to these terms</h2>
            <p>If these terms change, the version date at the top changes. A new account accepts the version that is current on that day.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2><Icon Name="mail" /> Contact</h2>
            <p>Write to <a href="mailto:privacy@blokemon.monster">privacy@blokemon.monster</a>. The <a href="privacy">Privacy Notice</a> tells you what Blokemon stores about you.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</article>
